"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[41787],{41787:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/4dae22efa8c0bb331657b2b61af3134a.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Lau Pa Sat Satay Street\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Skewers\\"\\n  address=\\"18 Raffles Quay, Singapore 048582\\"\\n  rating=4\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe famous satay street you must visit in Singapore.  \\n\\nThere were many touts as soon as I arrived, but I ordered from stalls #7 and #8, which are famous among Koreans.  \\nArriving right as it opened allowed me to order immediately, but the line became incredibly long shortly after.  \\nGoing early and deciding quickly is definitely the way to go.  \\n\\nThey gave me a buzzer, saying the cooking would take some time.  \\n\\nThe system involves closing the road and setting up tables and chairs.  \\nSince I was there at opening, I could see the setup happening in real-time.  \\n\\nI grabbed a spot I liked and bought beer and ice cups from a nearby convenience store.  \\n\\nCleaning staff wander around saying you shouldn\'t drink outside beer, but looking around, everyone was doing it.  \\n\\nIt was delicious with a nice smoky flavor, but not an exceptionally unique taste.  \\n\\nHowever, I recommend it for the great local atmosphere of sitting outdoors.\\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/ad5e3f5c6da7782a816c20e941189fa3.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Lau Pa Sat Satay Street\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);